<h1>Custom block helpers</h1>

{{! A block helper receives the block as `options.fn` and can call it
    zero, one, or many times, with any context. See helpers.js. }}

{{#bold}}This text is wrapped in &lt;strong&gt;.{{/bold}}

{{! Pass an array; the helper renders the block once per item. }}
{{#list people}}{{name}} — {{role}}{{/list}}

{{! Call the block N times, exposing @index1 (1-based) inside. }}
<p>{{#times 3}}{{@index1}}🔁{{/times}}</p>

{{!-- Helpers with an {{else}} (inverse) section. --}}
{{#ifEquals plan "pro"}}
  <p>Pro features unlocked.</p>
{{else}}
  <p>Upgrade for pro features.</p>
{{/ifEquals}}
